    <bpmn:process id="W_W4353" name="W4353. Live-Goods Shrink, Mortality &amp; Write-Off Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Plant death/unsellable detected; periodic write-off
Frequency: Continuous detection + periodic write-off
Volume: Live-goods mortality/shrink (benchmark 8–20% of live stock)
Owner: Garden Ops / Inventory (VS-05) / Finance (VS-17.4) / LP (VS-23)
Participants: Garden Ops, Inventory (VS-05), Finance (VS-17.4), LP (VS-23), Vendor (VS-03)
Source: workflow W4353 — Live-Goods Shrink, Mortality &amp; Write-Off Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4353_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4353_Lane1" name="Garden Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4353_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4353_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4353_Lane2" name="Inventory">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4353_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4353_Lane3" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4353_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4353_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4353_Start5" name="Plant death/unsellable detected; periodic write-off">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4353_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4353_Task6" name="Garden staff detect dead/unsellable plants, document cause (care, transit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden staff detect dead/unsellable plants, document cause (care, transit, vendor-quality, pest/disease), and segregate for disposition (W4355) or vendor-claim (W4338)
Responsible (R): Garden Staff / Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Garden Ops Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4353_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4353_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4353_Task7" name="Inventory/Finance write off the dead stock from inventory (VS-05) at cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inventory/Finance write off the dead stock from inventory (VS-05) at cost, attribute to BuildRight/consignor/vendor per terms (W4342), and post shrink
Responsible (R): Inventory / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4353_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4353_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4353_Task8" name="LP/Finance analyze shrink trends (by store/cause/vendor), file vendor claims…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP/Finance analyze shrink trends (by store/cause/vendor), file vendor claims (VS-90), and feed prevention (care, sourcing, transit)
Responsible (R): LP / Finance / Garden Ops
Accountable (A): LP Lead / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4353_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4353_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4353_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4353_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4353_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-667 (ensure controlled execution — Live-Goods Shrink, Markdown, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-145.3).) | - CTL-667: dead stock detected daily &amp; written off; cause documented; attributed per terms; vendor-claim filed (VS-90)
Owner: Garden Ops / Inventory (VS-05) / Finance (VS-17.4) / LP (VS-23)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4353_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4353_Annotation10" targetRef="W4353_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
