    <bpmn:process id="W_W4354" name="W4354. Decline/Markdown Trigger, Aging &amp; Clearance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Plant decline/aging detected (W4345); clearance cycle
Frequency: Daily decline-markdown + periodic clearance
Volume: Decline-markdown flow across live stock
Owner: Garden Ops / Pricing (VS-01.2) / Markdown (VS-64)
Participants: Garden Ops, Pricing (VS-01.2), Finance (VS-17.4), Marketing (VS-14), Inventory (VS-05)
Source: workflow W4354 — Decline/Markdown Trigger, Aging &amp; Clearance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4354_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4354_Lane1" name="Garden Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4354_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4354_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4354_Lane2" name="Pricing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4354_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4354_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4354_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4354_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4354_Start5" name="Plant decline/aging detected (W4345); clearance cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4354_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4354_Task6" name="Garden Ops apply the decline-markdown ladder (W4341) as plants age/stress —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Ops apply the decline-markdown ladder (W4341) as plants age/stress — health-grade → markdown level, prioritizing sell-through before mortality
Responsible (R): Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Garden Ops Lead
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4354_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4354_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4354_Task7" name="Pricing/Marketing set clearance mechanics (bundle, multi-buy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pricing/Marketing set clearance mechanics (bundle, multi-buy, donation-before-disposal) to maximize recovery of aging stock
Responsible (R): Pricing / Marketing
Accountable (A): Head of Merch / CMO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4354_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4354_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4354_Task8" name="Finance/RA track markdown margin impact, detect over/under-markdown, and feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/RA track markdown margin impact, detect over/under-markdown, and feed prevention (buy-sizing, care)
Responsible (R): Finance / RA
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4354_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4354_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4354_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4354_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4354_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-667 (ensure controlled execution — Live-Goods Shrink, Markdown, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-145.3).) | - CTL-667: decline-markdown ladder applied daily; clearance before disposal; margin RA-monitored (VS-118)
Owner: Garden Ops / Pricing (VS-01.2) / Markdown (VS-64)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
