        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HSE/Compliance set the pesticide/agrochemical handling standard — FPA (Fertilizer &amp; Pesticide Authority)-registered products only, SDS access, storage (segregation/ventilation per VS-114), application limits, PPE
