Responsible (R): HSE / Compliance
Accountable (A): HSE Mgr / Compliance Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4356_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4356_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
