      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/seasonal review
Frequency: Monthly + per-season
Volume: Garden-center category performance
Owner: Garden Buyer / Merch Analytics (VS-01) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Finance (VS-17.4), Garden Ops, Marketing (VS-14), Supply (VS-02)
Source: workflow W4359 — Garden Center Performance, Sell-Through &amp; Margin Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4359_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4359_Lane1" name="Garden Buyer">
