        <bpmn:outgoing>W4359_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4359_Task5" name="Garden Buyer/Analytics consolidate category KPIs — sell-through %, gross margin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Buyer/Analytics consolidate category KPIs — sell-through %, gross margin (post-markdown/shrink), shrink/mortality %, inventory-turn, attach-rate, seasonal-event ROI
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Merch / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4359_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4359_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4359_Task6" name="Merch/Strategy benchmark vs category target &amp; traffic/attach role, identify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merch/Strategy benchmark vs category target &amp; traffic/attach role, identify improvement (assortment, care, sourcing, markdown), and prioritize actions
Responsible (R): Merch / Strategy / Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4359_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4359_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4359_Task7" name="Garden Buyer/Finance report category contribution &amp; the perishability-adjusted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Garden Buyer/Finance report category contribution &amp; the perishability-adjusted margin, and feed the next seasonal plan (W4337/W4344)
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Merch / CFO
Duration: Per season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4359_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4359_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4359_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4359_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4359_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-667 (ensure controlled execution — Live-Goods Shrink, Markdown, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-145.3).) | - CTL-667: category KPIs reviewed monthly; perishability-adjusted margin tracked; improvement prioritized
Owner: Garden Buyer / Merch Analytics (VS-01) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
